0..78 Comment "// The moves subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by every"
79..157 Comment "// source that reads them (`import \"./file-base.gandr\" ;`): a file after POSIX"
158..234 Comment "// open(2) and close(2), whose descriptor its holder releases by closing it,"
235..313 Comment "// once. The handle is a linear resident, the end of a forked owner, so moving"
314..388 Comment "// it is delegation (Honda, Vasconcelos and Kubo, doi:10.1007/BFb0053567)."
390..469 Comment "/// A file: the handle its holder closes, the protocol of a closer that takes a"
470..545 Comment "/// handle and of a writer that takes one and hands it back, and the line a"
546..564 Comment "/// writer writes."
